DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Interval");

$set_ans_7 = Compute("[2, infinity) U [2, infinity) U {6, 8, 9, 13, 16}");
$set_ans_8 = Compute("{6, 8, 9, 13, 16} U (1, infinity) - ((-infinity, infinity) - [2, infinity)) U {6, 8, 9, 13, 16} U {6, 8, 9, 13, 16}");
$set_ans_9 = Compute("[2, infinity) U [2, infinity) U [2, infinity) U ((1, infinity))");
$set_ans_4 = Compute("(3, 6) U (3, 6) U (1, 10)");
$set_ans_5 = Compute("((3, 6)) U (3, 6) U ((1, 10)) U (3, 6)");
$set_ans_6 = Compute("((1, 10)) - ((-infinity, infinity) - (3, 6)) U (3, 6)");
$set_ans_1 = Compute("[5, infinity) U {0, 1, 2, 3, 9, 10} U {0, 1, 2, 3, 9, 10} U ({7, 10, 15, 17})");
$set_ans_2 = Compute("{0, 1, 2, 3, 9, 10} U ((({0, 1, 2, 3, 9, 10} U {0, 1, 2, 3, 9, 10})))");
$set_ans_3 = Compute("[5, infinity) U {7, 10, 15, 17} - ((-infinity, infinity) - {0, 1, 2, 3, 9, 10}) U [5, infinity)");
BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{0, 1, 2, 3, 9, 10\}`]
- [`B = \{x | x \geq 5\}`]
- [`C = \{7, 10, 15, 17\}`]

Compute:
- [`B \cup A \cup A \cup (C) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_1}
- [`A \cup (((A \cup A))) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_2}
- [`B \cup C \cap A \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_3}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | 3 < x < 6\}`]
- [`B = \{x | 1 < x < 10\}`]

Compute:
- [`A \cup A \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_4}
- [`(A) \cup A \cup (B) \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_5}
- [`(B) \cap A \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_6}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x > 0\}`]
- [`B = \{x | x \geq 2\}`]
- [`C = \{6, 8, 9, 13, 16\}`]

Compute:
- [`B \cup B \cup C = `] [_____]{$set_ans_7}
- [`C \cup A \cap B \cup C \cup C = `] [_____]{$set_ans_8}
- [`B \cup B \cup B \cup (A) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_9}

---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
